{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLAG-O-TRON is a new kind of deckbuilding with flags and chess pieces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/9010f97e8306fb5db41ec21e6a6f1612.poster.avif?t=1755728261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/9010f97e8306fb5db41ec21e6a6f1612.webm?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/9010f97e8306fb5db41ec21e6a6f1612.mp4?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Easy to pick up, deeply tactical as it unfolds \u2014 a flagbuilder that combines the recognizable structure of a roguelike with an original combo-building mechanic, offering dozens of unique decisions in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/95a454b43ef18830b03f18cbed5085bd.poster.avif?t=1755728261\" width=1440 height=810 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/95a454b43ef18830b03f18cbed5085bd.webm?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/95a454b43ef18830b03f18cbed5085bd.mp4?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No cards \u2014 just flags. No hand \u2014 just a board, where you create winning combos. </i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/aa374811e0419f95ad9ad19e1c1b9e62.poster.avif?t=1755728261\" width=800 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/aa374811e0419f95ad9ad19e1c1b9e62.webm?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/aa374811e0419f95ad9ad19e1c1b9e62.mp4?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Every turn is a decision. Every combo is a step toward victory \u2014 or defeat.</i> <br> <br>Use chess pieces to move flags across the board, unlock new slots in the shop, and upgrade your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategy, boost your flags with modifiers, discover rare upgrades, and create high-value chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, you\u2019ll face a boss. Who it\u2019ll be is a mystery \u2014 maybe one that wipes all upgrades from your active flags. Or one that turns every piece into a pawn, cutting off your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss comes with unique effects and interferes with the core mechanics, changing the rules mid-game. Sometimes they\u2019ll block movement, reset your score, strip away upgrades, or destroy key parts of the board. With every encounter, you\u2019ll need to rethink your strategy on the fly \u2014 adapt or lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLAGOTRON Demo</strong> gives you a sneak peek at the core gameplay loop, featuring 6 fast-paced rounds and <strong>two unique boss fights</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to share your feedback and help us improve the game while it's still in development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version is planned to include all <strong>193 country flags</strong>, <strong>15 main rounds</strong>, and an <strong>endless mode</strong>, along with multiple difficulty levels, a variety of <strong>starting decks</strong>, and additional game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886250?t=1755728261","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/99628e0d4ccd16ad7bc39ee2a6e26feba82a1c8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755728261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/40d0b8bc5f811cd3f05254a4037cfc7901ce2463/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755728261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/40d0b8bc5f811cd3f05254a4037cfc7901ce2463/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755728261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLAG-O-TRON is a new kind of deckbuilding with flags and chess pieces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/9010f97e8306fb5db41ec21e6a6f1612.poster.avif?t=1755728261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/9010f97e8306fb5db41ec21e6a6f1612.webm?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/9010f97e8306fb5db41ec21e6a6f1612.mp4?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Easy to pick up, deeply tactical as it unfolds \u2014 a flagbuilder that combines the recognizable structure of a roguelike with an original combo-building mechanic, offering dozens of unique decisions in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/95a454b43ef18830b03f18cbed5085bd.poster.avif?t=1755728261\" width=1440 height=810 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/95a454b43ef18830b03f18cbed5085bd.webm?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/95a454b43ef18830b03f18cbed5085bd.mp4?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No cards \u2014 just flags. No hand \u2014 just a board, where you create winning combos. </i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/aa374811e0419f95ad9ad19e1c1b9e62.poster.avif?t=1755728261\" width=800 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/aa374811e0419f95ad9ad19e1c1b9e62.webm?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/extras/aa374811e0419f95ad9ad19e1c1b9e62.mp4?t=1755728261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Every turn is a decision. Every combo is a step toward victory \u2014 or defeat.</i> <br> <br>Use chess pieces to move flags across the board, unlock new slots in the shop, and upgrade your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategy, boost your flags with modifiers, discover rare upgrades, and create high-value chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, you\u2019ll face a boss. Who it\u2019ll be is a mystery \u2014 maybe one that wipes all upgrades from your active flags. Or one that turns every piece into a pawn, cutting off your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss comes with unique effects and interferes with the core mechanics, changing the rules mid-game. Sometimes they\u2019ll block movement, reset your score, strip away upgrades, or destroy key parts of the board. With every encounter, you\u2019ll need to rethink your strategy on the fly \u2014 adapt or lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLAGOTRON Demo</strong> gives you a sneak peek at the core gameplay loop, featuring 6 fast-paced rounds and <strong>two unique boss fights</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to share your feedback and help us improve the game while it's still in development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version is planned to include all <strong>193 country flags</strong>, <strong>15 main rounds</strong>, and an <strong>endless mode</strong>, along with multiple difficulty levels, a variety of <strong>starting decks</strong>, and additional game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["RubyRooster"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3718740","name":"FLAG-O-TRON"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886250/5d93ce85dfcac876ac880de5fd84ff302d4243e9/header.jpg?t=1755728261","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257171080,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr